# SignalRankAI — Provider environment template (SAFE EXAMPLE ONLY)
# Copy variable names into Railway / your secret manager. Never commit real values.
# Credentials alone NEVER activate execution. Execution needs the separate
# *_EXECUTION_ENABLED=1 flag + certification + entitlement + opt-in.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public / keyless market data (work without credentials)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
